  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The wavelength shift of a photon that scatters off an electron is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta \\lambda\"></span>. </p>\n<p>What is the maximum value of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta \\lambda\"></span>? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{m_{e}c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{2m_{e}c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2h}{m_{e}c}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h\\sqrt{2}}{m_{e}c}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
